{
  "subject": "PnP.PowerShell 3.3.0 loaded assemblies: the properties each type actually exposes",
  "why_recorded": "Three defects reached a tenant because a property name was plausible and absent. SharingCapability is not a property of a site and Get-PnPSite -Includes rejects it outright. $context.Web.Title returns null unless the property was loaded. This file is the property set as the loaded assembly reports it, so that an -Includes clause naming something absent fails the build instead of a tenant.",
